# Config-first

Never hardcode UI copy or numeric business rules in JSX.

```ts
// ❌
<h1>داشبورد مدیر پروژه</h1>
if (cpi < 0.8) warn()

// ✅ features/manager/config.ts (or lib/*-config.ts)
export const DASHBOARD_CONFIG = {
  title: 'داشبورد مدیر پروژه',
} as const

// ✅ already in this repo: features/evm/lib/rag-status.ts
export const DEFAULT_RAG_THRESHOLDS = { onTrack: 0.95, critical: 0.85 }
```

In the component: `{DASHBOARD_CONFIG.title}` and `DEFAULT_RAG_THRESHOLDS.critical`.

## Also required in UI

- Latin digits: `fa-IR-u-nu-latn` (via existing `faNumber` / format helpers)
- Primary actions stay orange (`primary` / existing tokens)
- Do not paste secrets or commit `scripts/.msp-curve-probe.txt`
